A new book celebrating the 70th anniversary of the founding of Theatre in the Round at the Library Theatre in Scarborough - where Alan Ayckbourn. made his debut as playwright and director - is being released on 10 July in Scarborough.

Find out more details about A Theatrical Revolution by Simon Murgatroyd and its launch at The Library Theatre Exhibition at 70 at Scarborough Library (10 - 12 July 2025, visit the Ayckbourn Blog http://blog.alanayckbourn.net or via the bio link above

