Alan Ayckbourn's directorial debut in 1961 is the focus of the Ayckbourn Blog's continued celebration of the 70th anniversary of the founding of Scarborough's Theatre in the Round at the Library Theatre.

Find out more about his production of Patrick Hamilton's classic Gaslight by clicking the blog link on the bio at the top of the page.

