Absolutely delighted to have given the inaugural guest talk at Beeforth’s Hive yesterday about the proposed theatre-in-the-round on The Esplanade during the ‘70s.

A great audience in a lovely space. I look forward to returning with more stories about Scarborough’s theatrical heritage.

